# What must not enter the image, and why.
#
# Build outputs and incremental state are the subtle ones. `tsc --build` decides what to emit from
# `.tsbuildinfo`, so copying the host's in while excluding `dist` tells the compiler everything is
# already built and it emits nothing at all -- a build that succeeds and produces no output.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# The old SQLite database holds password hashes and session tokens. A bare `*.db` only matches the
# repository root; these live under packages/.
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# Secrets stay in the environment at run time, never in a layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
coverage
**/.DS_Store
